### 📌 Academic Database Systems Project

A comprehensive transportation management platform developed using modern web technologies and a fully normalized relational database design. The system automates shipment processing, fleet management, payment handling, invoice generation, delivery verification, and company logistics operations.

</div>

---

# 🎯 CCP-3 Project Completion Summary

The CCP-3 milestone focused on converting the conceptual database design into a fully implemented and operational system. This phase included database implementation, normalization verification, frontend development, backend development, API integration, database programmability, and business rule enforcement.

---

# 🏆 Major Accomplishments

### Database Engineering

* ✅ Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD) Design
* ✅ Relational Schema Development
* ✅ Functional Dependency Analysis
* ✅ Candidate Key Identification
* ✅ Database Normalization up to Third Normal Form (3NF)
* ✅ Referential Integrity Implementation
* ✅ Constraint Enforcement

### Application Development

* ✅ React.js Frontend
* ✅ Node.js Backend
* ✅ Express.js REST APIs
* ✅ MySQL Database Connectivity
* ✅ OpenRouteService Integration

### Database Programmability

* ✅ 19 Database Triggers
* ✅ 4 Stored Procedures
* ✅ Automated Business Rule Enforcement
* ✅ Workflow Automation

### Testing and Validation

* ✅ API Testing using Thunder Client
* ✅ Database Testing
* ✅ Business Rule Verification
* ✅ CRUD Operations Validation

