## Implemented Stored Procedures (4)

| Procedure                  | Purpose                         |
| -------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| sp_update_user_password    | Updates Admin/TM/FM Passwords   |
| sp_update_company_password | Updates Company Password        |
| sp_resolve_cancellation    | Processes Cancellation Requests |
| sp_approve_cod_payment     | Approves COD Payments           |

---

# 🌍 OpenRouteService Integration

The system integrates OpenRouteService API for:

* Route Generation
* Distance Calculation
* Delivery Cost Computation
* Transportation Planning

The API was selected because it provides reliable routing functionality without the cost limitations associated with commercial GPS APIs.

---

# 🔒 Security Features

* Password Hashing
* Authentication Controls
* Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
* Input Validation
* Secure Database Access
* Protected API Endpoints

---

# 📊 Project Outcome

The Vehicle Transportation Management System successfully demonstrates:

* Advanced Database Design
* Relational Database Implementation
* Full-Stack Web Development
* Database Programmability
* Business Rule Automation
* API Integration
* Software Engineering Best Practices

The final system provides a scalable and maintainable vehicle management platform capable of handling transportation operations efficiently while maintaining database integrity and operational reliability.

